{
  "sn12.27:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 12.27 ",
  "sn12.27:0.2": "3. Dasabalavagga ",
  "sn12.27:0.3": "Paccayasutta ",
  "sn12.27:1.1": "Sāvatthiyaṁ viharati. ",
  "sn12.27:1.2": "“Avijjāpaccayā, bhikkhave, saṅkhārā; ",
  "sn12.27:1.3": "saṅkhārapaccayā viññāṇaṁ …pe… ",
  "sn12.27:1.4": "evametassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa samudayo hoti. ",
  "sn12.27:2.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, jarāmaraṇaṁ? ",
  "sn12.27:2.2": "Yā tesaṁ tesaṁ sattānaṁ tamhi tamhi sattanikāye jarā jīraṇatā khaṇḍiccaṁ pāliccaṁ valittacatā āyuno saṁhāni indriyānaṁ paripāko—",
  "sn12.27:2.3": "ayaṁ vuccati jarā. ",
  "sn12.27:2.4": "Yā tesaṁ tesaṁ sattānaṁ tamhā tamhā sattanikāyā cuti cavanatā bhedo antaradhānaṁ maccu maraṇaṁ kālakiriyā khandhānaṁ bhedo kaḷevarassa nikkhepo; ",
  "sn12.27:2.5": "idaṁ vuccati maraṇaṁ. ",
  "sn12.27:2.6": "Iti ayañca jarā idañca maraṇaṁ. ",
  "sn12.27:2.7": "Idaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, jarāmaraṇaṁ. ",
  "sn12.27:2.8": "Jātisamudayā jarāmaraṇasamudayo; ",
  "sn12.27:2.9": "jātinirodhā jarāmaraṇanirodho. ",
  "sn12.27:2.10": "Ayameva ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo jarāmaraṇanirodhagāminī paṭipadā. ",
  "sn12.27:2.11": "Seyyathidaṁ—sammādiṭṭhi, sammāsaṅkappo, sammāvācā, sammākammanto, sammāājīvo, sammāvāyāmo, sammāsati, sammāsamādhi. ",
  "sn12.27:3.1": "Katamā ca, bhikkhave, jāti …pe… ",
  "sn12.27:3.2": "katamo ca, bhikkhave, bhavo … ",
  "sn12.27:3.3"